    "summary": "# Briefing: SFERS Proposal Copy Requirement\n\n## Conclusion\n**The number of printed copies required for the SFERS general investment consultant RFP cannot be determined from the provided evidence.**\n\n## Basis for This Conclusion\n- The evidence **does not include** the actual **San Francisco Employees' Retirement System (SFERS)** general investment consultant RFP.\n- The retrieved materials refer to **other retirement systems**, not SFERS.\n- Because submission requirements vary by agency, those other examples **cannot be used to infer** SFERS’s requirement.\n\n## Related Findings in the Evidence\n- **SBCERS**: conflicting instructions stating **three (3)** printed copies in one place and **seven (3)** printed copies in another.\n- **BRS**: requires **seven (7)** printed copies and **one electronic version**.\n- **OCERS**: requires **electronic submission only**.\n- **TMRS**: requires **three electronic proposals**, not printed copies.\n\n## Assessment\n**No direct answer is available** in the provided materials for how many printed copies must be submitted for the **SFERS** general investment consultant RFP."
